        "description": "Several security issues were discovered in the Linux kernel. An attacker could possibly use these to compromise the system. This update corrects flaws in the following subsystems:   - ARM64 architecture;   - Cryptographic API;   - UDF file system;   - NFC subsystem;   - Network traffic control; (CVE-2024-46777, CVE-2025-21735, CVE-2025-37849, CVE-2026-23060, CVE-2026-23074)",
